      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies and vendors dominate federal contracting in Kentucky right now?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the largest buying agency in FY2027 to date at $39.5M, followed by the Department of the Treasury at $17.9M and the Department of Agriculture at $1.2M. WIELAND ROLLED PRODUCTS NORTH AMERICA, LLC is the largest vendor in FY2027 to date at $17.9M, followed by UNIVERSITY OF LOUISVILLE at $7.1M and PDS CONSULTANTS, INC at $5.2M. Copper Rolling, Drawing, Extruding, and Alloying is the top industry at $17.9M, and Colleges, Universities, and Professional Schools account for $7.4M."
